 /* amended C1 (W3 7654 4c; W1 7656, W2, W3 agreed): a critical point holds at least two different verses, each quoted with its reference on its own tagged layer line ([L1] or [L3]), at least one [L1]; an [L2] never counts and a reference in prose does not count. The ANSWER row (ANSWER: Ref -- Dn -- "verse") and the MEANS row (Ref "verse" -- MEANS:) read as [L1] lines with their reference. LIMIT: two verses of one sentence count as two. */
