 /* ASK 366 verse-row match (W2's form; W4 7735 items 3 and 4; W1 7736 points a to d; W2 7738 points a and b): a quotation counts for its reference only when its words stand in that verse's kjv_verses row (for a range, the rows joined in order): folded to lower case, curly and straight apostrophes alike, a bracket holding a colon (a 1611 margin note) removed, italic brackets dropped with their words kept, punctuation removed; each fragment either side of "..." is one unbroken run of at least two words inside the row. A reference with no row falls back to the rule before this ask, except that nothing is paired inside an [L4] line (W3 7728/7731). Rows are read from the eight Verse Sheet nodes already run (sheet()); a misquoted verse does not count (ruling: misstated verses are not accepted). */
